{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>著名龍虎武師、劉家良入室弟子何麥（Mark Houghton）於2026年10月5日離世，終年64歲，今日在紅磡世界殯儀館，翌日出殯。靈堂佈置簡潔莊嚴 遺孀粉紅</p><p>著名龍虎武師、劉家良入室弟子何麥（Mark Houghton）於2026年10月5日離世，終年64歲，今日在紅磡世界殯儀館，翌日出殯。</p><figure><img alt=\"著名龍虎武師何麥喪禮在紅磡世界殯儀館舉行。（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261028/1192176414250504192039567.jpeg/sbMveqo7bxlVtntLk3tCtGsHQAzM5pB31tXBm-zVwZs\"/><figcaption>著名龍虎武師何麥喪禮在紅磡世界殯儀館舉行。（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><p>靈堂佈置簡潔莊嚴 遺孀粉紅心形花牌道深情</p><p>現場所見，靈堂佈置簡潔而莊嚴，中央掛著何麥身穿唐裝的彩色遺照，遺照上方橫匾寫有「永遠懷念」四字。靈堂正前方放著由何麥遺孀Christie送上的粉紅色心型花牌，上面寫道：「何麥夫君冥鑒 永遠懷念 妻Christie Hung」，字裏行間流露出對亡夫的思念。承受喪夫之痛的Christie身穿孝服，神情難掩哀傷，到場致哀的賓客紛紛上前送上安慰。</p><figure><img alt=\"何麥是劉家良入室弟子。（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261028/1192176572782612480641753.jpeg/HsPVRXatDGTBTp5Ff-Yg_NYI6TPQEASbEvz7Kij8-yo\"/><figcaption>何麥是劉家良入室弟子。（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><p>家人低調婉拒採訪 師母翁靜晶花牌置首列</p><p>何麥家人對後事處理非常低調，現場婉拒了傳媒的採訪。女兒何慈茵今日亦未有現身靈堂，也未見其送上的花牌。而師母翁靜晶的花牌則被安排與家屬花牌一同擺放在首列顯眼位置，花牌寫著：「愛徒何麥千古 武格長存」，足見二人深厚情誼。</p><figure><img alt=\"何麥遺孀難掩哀傷。（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261028/1192177478915854336201854.jpeg/4iNlQx3tpXmq73lptycQRPatFrzwM68JBGTzcj5k83I\"/><figcaption>何麥遺孀難掩哀傷。（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><p>香港動作特技演員公會致意 故友火星親臨現場送別</p><p>何麥生前在港產動作片輝煌時期貢獻良多，靈堂內、外擺滿悼念花牌。當中包括何麥生前的一眾徒弟、香港動作特技演員公會，以及錢嘉樂與太太湯盈盈等。此外，同為武師出身的資深動作演員火星更親身前往靈堂送別故友。</p><figure><img alt=\"何麥曾擔任史泰龍保鑣。(何慈茵IG)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220222/572796854564425728309685.jpeg/QL8vzV2idHh1BzqtaQS594X0flOaoAWpFySKnBckipw\"/><figcaption>何麥曾擔任史泰龍保鑣。(何慈茵IG)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"錢嘉樂與太太湯盈盈送上花牌。（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261028/1192177012442140672540829.jpeg/AJSy7xwi3FXUtqqlLsnkPS80u4ZN_kC776y3xtWst8Y\"/><figcaption>錢嘉樂與太太湯盈盈送上花牌。（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不少好友送花牌致哀！（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261028/1192178352224997376698234.jpeg/8pn7KKzy1PGxXyxZPbbx2SukVFeZPpo8Zpp4ZmaaeGY\"/><figcaption>不少好友送花牌致哀！（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不少好友送花牌致哀！（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261028/1192178349515345920380471.jpeg/oz_kUd6Mk58rj4wXw_Z6YZb6d1vJm_PpD7T72A-0-9g\"/><figcaption>不少好友送花牌致哀！（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不少好友送花牌致哀！（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261028/1192178346734391296724165.jpeg/ovhCdzRAYbR5yyALueNkMnUqKHs0qwchZ64jImeuIyI\"/><figcaption>不少好友送花牌致哀！（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不少好友送花牌致哀！（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261028/1192178344049905664574890.jpeg/3SKH8_NyyEZWLGJMqv4OzslgPLRTe3fR7dAKve3QCr0\"/><figcaption>不少好友送花牌致哀！（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不少好友送花牌致哀！（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261028/1192178340979544064736459.jpeg/jChSBai-T1qhpq3Hj0_IvTIl2J7k4RcLIY9YOiGPWDo\"/><figcaption>不少好友送花牌致哀！（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不少好友送花牌致哀！（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261028/1192178351889453056258371.jpeg/ZtVqtqWsHPSIxEK7lxpzenWdirp3V-PqtzEldrcxJXY\"/><figcaption>不少好友送花牌致哀！（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不少好友送花牌致哀！（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261028/1192178349418876928431527.jpeg/dnd1zWcBqK1vl0gB8GpDwq9-Le84XUtHQRSZiEEUmYg\"/><figcaption>不少好友送花牌致哀！（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不少好友送花牌致哀！（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261028/1192178346843443200915638.jpeg/C6BDm31IfbdYlOjamAfUbhSq-ReQGfApcyGibHMhomw\"/><figcaption>不少好友送花牌致哀！（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不少好友送花牌致哀！（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261028/1192178343945048064372514.jpeg/BpEUhQX_y25_uhsJUnuL2xH_7bV5Vt4ewaf9NMGn_TQ\"/><figcaption>不少好友送花牌致哀！（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不少好友送花牌致哀！（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261028/1192178340866297856306518.jpeg/la04e5lNcUxL2liPN26lxgCJKa-gkUl6mvsYgpr7GII\"/><figcaption>不少好友送花牌致哀！（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不少好友送花牌致哀！（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261028/1192178350887014400572610.jpeg/2T31mt72Ivm9wqp2SsYff9bzkfA3NabFUxix1VMYsdU\"/><figcaption>不少好友送花牌致哀！（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不少好友送花牌致哀！（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261028/1192178347841818624846503.jpeg/P3EApuytoqk9Q7yMRmtJyPA5BiKc2I2ELsf5ky7H-ZM\"/><figcaption>不少好友送花牌致哀！（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不少好友送花牌致哀！（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261028/1192178345216053248946173.jpeg/hzQEWbttdlU6xx3OTD8x7lEHzqUX5Hzpn6VC6p-lQuo\"/><figcaption>不少好友送花牌致哀！（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不少好友送花牌致哀！（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261028/1192178342439292928218365.jpeg/-l83nkVSGmW_AEmSIk3Sa4_M1PtTRwabdzVvI3c1byM\"/><figcaption>不少好友送花牌致哀！（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不少好友送花牌致哀！（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261028/1192178339515731968263549.jpeg/okueGTVU76K13j4XKe8hoM6A8tKbQbtJdVz91nVc_dY\"/><figcaption>不少好友送花牌致哀！（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T10:42:03.610942+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":954,"images":20,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T10:18:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T10:58:39.835938+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T10:38:41.341373+00:00","content_hash":"4f390d30980bbc58576ad3f46a47abcabb10fd3ec18393e76fff64851dd9428f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}